  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "77320712ddda0596",
      "translationZh": "衡量迈向 AGI 的进展：认知框架",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b086181cd3c025ed",
      "translationZh": "我们正在推出一个衡量迈向 AGI 进展的框架，并发起一场 Kaggle 黑客松，以构建相关评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91a5f5e3bafd2520",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 研究科学家",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52ce2e9a444c7ed5",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 产品经理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e409b2ac56c2fc1",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 希望利用认知科学，帮助衡量通用人工智能（AGI）的进展。他们的新论文《衡量迈向 AGI 的进展：认知分类体系》提出了一个框架，用于理解 AI 系统的认知能力。您可以参加他们举办的 Kaggle 黑客松，为关键认知能力设计评估，并有机会赢取总额为 200,000 的奖金池中的奖金。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "852534efa6fb7d65",
      "translationZh": "通用人工智能（AGI）有潜力加速科学发现，并帮助解决人类面临的一些最紧迫的问题。但要知道我们距离这一关键里程碑有多近，可能并不容易，因为目前缺乏用于评估系统通用智能的实证工具。追踪迈向 AGI 的进展需要多种方法和路径，而我们认为，认知科学提供了其中一块重要的拼图。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24f2bdf9276b9674",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们今天发布了一篇新论文《衡量迈向 AGI 的进展：认知分类体系》，为理解 AI 系统的认知能力提供科学基础。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3b2a3ce4eba5456",
      "translationZh": "在发布论文的同时，我们正与 Kaggle 合作举办一场黑客马拉松，邀请研究界帮助构建将这一框架付诸实践所需的评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0f8e7bf2ea961f33",
      "translationZh": "解构通用智能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00e6dfae2ddc3d86",
      "translationZh": "我们的框架借鉴了心理学、神经科学和认知科学数十年来的研究，以构建一个认知分类体系。它确定了 10 项关键认知能力，我们假设这些能力对 AI 系统的通用智能具有重要意义：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "583287ef0ce30747",
      "translationZh": "感知：从环境中提取和处理感官信息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f4136a1f5138d044",
      "translationZh": "生成：产生文本、语音和动作等输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0abf85bafd04af8",
      "translationZh": "注意：将认知资源集中于重要的事物",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8326396dce3d367c",
      "translationZh": "学习：通过经验和指导获取新知识",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "468bf7ab5230d7e2",
      "translationZh": "记忆：随时间推移存储和提取信息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e791f6862bebf028",
      "translationZh": "推理：通过逻辑推断得出有效结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c302130f4589561f",
      "translationZh": "元认知：了解并监控自身的认知过程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "efa6df0aeaa2c8d3",
      "translationZh": "执行功能：规划、抑制和认知灵活性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "965f95e70fb53fdd",
      "translationZh": "问题解决：为特定领域的问题寻找有效的解决方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fe0de53fa99df947",
      "translationZh": "社会认知：处理和解读社会信息，并在社交情境中作出恰当回应",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a89487ce75fd5642",
      "translationZh": "为了解 AI 在这些认知能力方面的表现，我们提出了一套三阶段评估流程，以人类能力为参照对系统表现进行基准评估：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "585f9facd572935b",
      "translationZh": "使用涵盖每项能力的广泛认知任务集来评估 AI 系统，并采用留出测试集来防止数据污染",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9d88fd7df6dd2b6e",
      "translationZh": "从在人口统计特征上具有代表性的成年人样本中，收集相同任务的人类基线数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f2c3e3709811413",
      "translationZh": "将每个 AI 系统的表现映射到各项能力的人类表现分布中，以确定其相对位置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fe8e008218be58cb",
      "translationZh": "从理论走向实践",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dad363e85be6af24",
      "translationZh": "定义这些认知能力是至关重要的第一步，但要衡量进展，我们需要的不仅仅是一个框架。为将这一理论付诸实践，我们正在推出一项新的 Kaggle 黑客松——“衡量迈向 AGI 的进展：认知能力”。这项黑客松鼓励社区为评估缺口最大的五项认知能力设计评估：学习、元认知、注意力、执行功能和社会认知。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57c2fb542c7c6996",
      "translationZh": "参与者可以使用 Kaggle 新推出的 Community Benchmarks 平台，构建自己的评估，并针对一系列前沿模型进行测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1f3e87d8a9cd0a3",
      "translationZh": "我们提供的总奖金池为 200,000：五个赛道中每个赛道排名前两位的提交作品各获 10,000 奖金，综合表现最出色的四个提交作品各获 25,000 大奖。提交时间为 3 月 17 日至 4 月 16 日，我们将于 6 月 1 日公布结果。前往 Kaggle 网站，开始构建吧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba07e0e30582b629",
      "translationZh": "在你的收件箱中获取 Google 的最新消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c2f6429af68386",
      "translationZh": "完成了。只差最后一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177af4ad1775d8ae",
      "translationZh": "请查看收件箱，确认你的订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff091e7a47df15e",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用一个 来订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在2026年9月公布的最新 AI 消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0427f9d1d93e63e6",
      "translationZh": "我们推出 SynthID Bio，将我们的水印技术应用于合成生物学。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "62ce7c10cc4bc1b1",
      "translationZh": "逐帧重现一段跨越70年的爱情故事",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "be43eabc9ca8f6c6",
      "translationZh": "AlphaGenome Atlas：人类 DNA 的高分辨率图谱",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
